Subject: [PATCH 05/17] ARM: Remove deprecated IRQF_DISABLED flag
Date: Mon, 30 Dec 2013 17:09:19 +0100
Message-Id: <1388419771-30075-5-git-send-email-daniel.lezcano@linaro.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.9.5
